text = "Oh, that was some nice encouragement you got there, after that somewhat complicated investigation.
Let’s hope you didn’t make a mistake.
BTW, the game developer wanted to put a picture of Jeffrey Epstein in the CEO’s spot, but he thought it was a bit inappropriate for a Jam. But he mentioned it, just in case it makes anyone laugh.

Anyway, the rest is simple.
Find the word from the English Wordle as it is/was when you started working on the secret code. You have to add the word you found in the code.
If you are playing on the Web version, the answer is \"WordL\" ."
autowrap_mode = 3
